{"id":"babysitter","lemma":"Babysitter","pos":"noun","rank":3367,"glosses":["babysitter"],"ipa":"/ˈbeːbiˌsɪtɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7c/De-Babysitter.ogg/De-Babysitter.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Babysitters","plural":"Babysitter","feminine":"Babysitter"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich denke, wir müssen uns einen neuen Babysitter suchen.","en":"I think we need to find a new babysitter.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},null,{"g":"to search, to look for"}]},{"text":"Tom konnte keinen Babysitter finden.","en":"Tom couldn't find a babysitter.","words":[null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"to find"}]},{"text":"Tom ist gerne Babysitter.","en":"Tom likes being a babysitter.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"don't mention it"},null]},{"text":"Der Babysitter versuchte, das Baby in den Schlaf zu singen.","en":"The babysitter tried to sing the baby to sleep.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"versuchen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"baby"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"sleep"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to sing"}]},{"text":"Brauchst du immer noch einen Babysitter für Montagnacht?","en":"Do you still need a babysitter for Monday night?","words":[{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"you"},null,null,{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"for"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"still"]]}]}